# Wifi credentials. secrets.h.example is the template; secrets.h is yours.
firmware/elegoo_cam_station/secrets.h

# Agent run logs. Every run writes frames of whatever room the car was in,
# which is a photographic record of somebody's home. Keep them locally.
runs/

# Photographs of the build, and camera captures from the calibration runs.
selfies/
*.jpg

# Elegoo's official download bundle, 262 MB. Their copyright, not ours to
# redistribute, and it is a free download from elegoo.com. The camera source
# in it is ground truth for the pin map, so get your own copy: see the
# References section of CLAUDE.md.
elegoo-docs/

# A 4 MB dump of the stock camera firmware, read off this specific chip. Keep
# your own backup before you flash anything; do not rely on someone else's.
*.bin

# Local tooling
ant/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# One-off diagnostics from a long day of chasing a car that would not drive
# straight, would not stop, and then would not turn. What each of them found
# is written up in CLAUDE.md, which is the part worth keeping; the scripts
# themselves were disposable and several were built on wrong theories.
stop_probe.py
wedge_probe.py
stop_diff.py
motor_map_test.py
straight_test.py
turn_test.py
elegoo_probe.py
capture_serial.py
smoke_test.py
firmware/camera_pin_probe/

# Raw session logs. The measurements taken from them are in CLAUDE.md.
*.txt
!requirements.txt

# Superseded background research. CLAUDE.md wins where the two disagree.
feasibility-report.html
